WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.767
Before writing nested queries inspect the underlying
rows Run this

00:00:05.793 --> 00:00:11.346
simple SELECT and look at the patient IDs and ages
Later when the

00:00:11.373 --> 00:00:15.241
subquery returns a set of IDs or an average age you
will be able to

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:20.974
connect the result back to real rows in the teaching
dataset This is also

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.911
a good real-world habit Understand the source tables
before debugging a complex query
